# [QUIC](../wg/quic.html)

## Summary

The QUIC Working Group met to discuss working group drafts and proposal updates across load balancing, structured logging, receive timestamps, delegated stateless resets, congestion control data exchange, and peer-to-peer/NAT traversal. Key highlights include preparing QUIC-LB for Working Group Last Call (WGLC), streamlining qlog by removing TLS-specific layering violations, progressing receive timestamps towards WGLC, and confirming strong working group interest in solving orphan connection resets caused by process crashes.

