### [Cuback](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-quic-cuback-00)
- **Presenter**: Kazuho Oku
- **Technical Overview**:
  - Introduces Cuback, an ACK-clocked formulation of Cubic that replaces complex window-tracking state machines with a pure `dW` function computed upon entering recovery.
  - Significantly simplifies implementation complexity while achieving faster convergence than standard Cubic in competing traffic scenarios.
  - Detailed technical discussions will take place in CCWG / ICCRG.

